SUMMARY:The Drawing Lab with Deb Putnoi: Session V
LOCATION:The Muse
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: soldOut\nEvent URL: ht
 tps://members.thequinhouse.com/events/188309\n\nSaturdays: February 28\, M
 arch 28\, April 25\, May 30 & June 27 | 10:00AM The Terrace & The Muse\nJo
 in us for The Drawing Lab\, a six class immersive drawing course led by ar
 tist and educator Deb Putnoi\, exploring the method as a practice of mindf
 ulness\, observation\, and self-expression. Open to all experience levels\
 , this course invites members to discover their unique visual voice throug
 h guided exercises\, sensory awareness\, and creative connection.\n\nMeet 
 likeminded members on reoccurring Saturdays over coffee and light bites wh
 ile experimenting with a range of materials and methods\, drawing inspirat
 ion from one another and The ’Quin Collection. Registration includes com
 mitment to participate in all six sessions.\n\n*This six-month course is r
 eserved for members only. The $120 per person fee includes all materials n
 eeded for the duration of the program. Please note that registration for t
 his course is final and non-cancelable\, and may not be transferred.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/188309
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
