SUMMARY:CBS Sports Golazo Network Live Taping: "Call It What You Want" Podc
 ast
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 39 spots l
 eft\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events
 /188593\n\n2:00PM Doors Open\, 2:30PM Pre-Match Commentary\, 3:00PM Match\
 nJoin CBS Sports Golazo Network for a live taping of Call It What You Wa
 nt featuring United States Men's National Team (USMNT) legends and leadin
 g soccer voices Jimmy Conrad\, Marcelo Balboa\, and Charlie Davies as they
  break down the USMNT's friendly match against Senegal ahead of the World 
 Cup.\n\nBlending live match commentary\, tournament predictions\, insider 
 analysis\, and post-match discussion\, the afternoon offers 'Quin members 
 an immersive look into the current state of the USMNT and the global socce
 r landscape leading into the world’s biggest stage. Members will also ha
 ve the opportunity to engage directly with the hosts during an interactive
  audience Q&A\, bringing fans closer to the conversation shaping the futur
 e of the game. The Pub will sport a cash bar and à la carte stadium-style
  menu available for purchase throughout the game. \n\n*This event is rese
 rved for members\, plus three registered guests. This is a lively receptio
 n-style game viewing event\, therefore seats will be reduced (not guarante
 ed) for this occasion in favor of standing room to accommodate all attende
 es.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/188593
CATEGORIES:Sports & Games
