BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-175777@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260601T170000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260601T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260601T183000
SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: How to Start Collecting
LOCATION:The Reading Room
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent U
 RL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/175777\n\n5:00PM Reception\, 5
 :30PM Discussion\nStep inside the art market with those who know it best. 
 Join ’Quin House Art Curator Kate Chertavian in conversation with Simon 
 Shaw\, Senior Advisor and Co-Head of Impressionist and Modern Art at Sothe
 by’s\, for an insider’s look at how collections are shaped\, valued\, 
 and sustained over time.\n\nDrawing on decades of experience across auctio
 n houses\, private collections\, and global markets\, the discussion will 
 explore how to build with intention—navigating auctions and galleries\, 
 evaluating works\, resisting fleeting trends\, and ultimately defining a p
 oint of view that is distinctly your own. Thoughtful\, candid\, and deeply
  informed\, this is a rare opportunity to hear directly from two leading v
 oices at the highest levels of the art world.\n\n*This event is compliment
 ary and reserved for members only. Light refreshments will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/175777
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
