DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avai
 lable\nTime: 5 PM – 9 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/184860\n\nCelebrate the season close to home with Taste of New Englan
 d Farms\, a dinner experience inspired by the region’s rich agricultural
  heritage and the quiet beauty of its landscapes. Available exclusively du
 ring dinner service\, this limited-time offering highlights the peak of lo
 cal harvest—thoughtfully sourced\, simply prepared\, and rooted in a sen
 se of place.\n\nEach course reflects New England’s balance of rustic tra
 dition and refined technique\, where farm-fresh ingredients take center st
 age and familiar flavors are elevated with care.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/184860
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
