SUMMARY:Game Night: Bridge: Beyond Basics
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nE
 vent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/185004\n\nDiscover the a
 rt and strategy of Bridge in a thoughtfully designed two-part series for m
 embers ready to deepen their understanding of the game. Open to those who 
 joined our March and May gatherings—as well as anyone with a foundationa
 l knowledge of Bridge—these sessions offer the perfect next step for bui
 lding confidence at the table.\n\nLed by an expert guest instructor\, each
  evening will blend guided play with focused instruction. Expect a relaxed
 \, hands-on atmosphere with ample opportunity to play multiple hands\, ask
  questions\, and develop your strategy in real time.\n\nBy the series’ e
 nd\, members will feel equipped to gather and play with ease\, carrying fo
 rward both the skill and the spirit of this timeless game alongside fellow
  members.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. P
 lease note that this is a two-part series\; registration for the first ses
 sion on June 1st will automatically enroll you in the second session on Ju
 ne 8th\, ensuring a cohesive learning experience across both evenings.
