 .com/events/186727\n\nJoin us for a Pride Edition of Serendipity Saturday 
 Brunch—a celebration of community\, conversation\, and connection. Set i
 n Lunasol\, the afternoon unfolds with a vibrant energy\, where members ga
 ther around a thoughtfully curated menu and a spirit of inclusivity. Conve
 rsation prompts invite moments of reflection\, storytelling\, and shared p
 erspective—honoring the voices and experiences that make our community s
 o dynamic.\n\nBrunch will be served family-style\, featuring pastries\, fr
 uit\, and parfaits to begin\, followed by a choice of entrée and generous
  sides. Mimosas and Bloody Marys will be available throughout.\n\nSpend th
 e day at The 'House—unhurried\, social\, and effortlessly enjoyable.\n\n
 *Tickets are $65 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only
 . Cancellations within 48 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will
  be charged in full. Please inform us of any dietary needs or restrictions
  by emailing happening@thequin.com at least 72 hours prior to the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/186727
